  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/03/P1540318.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(18 fotos) Este domingo, 26 de marzo, de 12 a 15.30 y de 17.30 a 20 horas, se abre por &uacute;ltimo d&iacute;a en el Mercat de la Tapineria, en la calle del mismo nombre de Val&egrave;ncia, la muestra TAKE AWAY ART en la que se puede ver y comprar por s&oacute;lo 10 euros cada l&aacute;mina obra de Lluna Llunera, nombre art&iacute;stico de la ondense Irene Garcia Molina.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenearttakeawayvalencia/p1540279.jpg\" alt=\"p1540279\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenearttakeawayvalencia/p1540281.jpg\" alt=\"p1540281\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenearttakeawayvalencia/p1540283.jpg\" alt=\"p1540283\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenearttakeawayvalencia/p1540284.jpg\" alt=\"p1540284\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenearttakeawayvalencia/p1540285.jpg\" alt=\"p1540285\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenearttakeawayvalencia/p1540288.jpg\" alt=\"p1540288\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenearttakeawayvalencia/p1540290.jpg\" alt=\"p1540290\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenearttakeawayvalencia/p1540295.jpg\" alt=\"p1540295\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/irenearttakeawayvalencia/p1